{"id":"NCT07610473","title":"A Study to Evaluate the Effectiveness of DT-101 as an Adjunctive Treatment in Patients With Depression","official":"A Phase 2 Double-blind, Randomised, Placebo-controlled Trial to Evaluate the Efficacy, Safety, Pharmacokinetics, and Pharmacodynamics of DT-101 in Adults With Major Depressive Disorder Receiving Pharmacological Therapy for Depression","summary":"In this study, researchers will learn more about a study drug called DT-101 in participants with Major Depressive Disorder (MDD), a form of depression. The goal of this clinical trial is to learn if DT-101 can treat depression in adults. The effect of DT-101 will be compared to placebo. A placebo looks the drug but contains no medicine. Subjects will attend the clinic for complete general health checks and to complete questionnaires.","conditions":["Major Depressive Disorder (MDD)"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"DT-101"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Placebo"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* The participant is able to read, understand and communicate in the local language used at the study site, and is willing to provide written informed consent\n* Male or female (assigned at birth, inclusive of all gender identities) participant must be 18 to 75 years of age, inclusive at the time of signing the informed consent.\n* Has recurrent depression (defined as at least one prior episode excluding the current one), as diagnosed by DSM 5-TR (Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders, 2022).\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Pregnant or breastfeeding or plans to become pregnant during the study.\n* Unstable medical condition or unstable chronic disease.\n* Significant neurological abnormality.\n* History of moderate or severe alcohol or drug use disorder as per DSM-5-TR in the 6 months prior to Screening.\n* History of seizure.\n* In the investigator's opinion, the participant is not capable of adhering to the protocol requirements.","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"75 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":118,"start":"2026-05-14","pcd":"2027-05","upd":"2026-10-14","sponsor":"Draig Therapeutics Ltd","areas":["other"],"central":["Aeron-1 Clinical Team · +44(0)2920028450 · info@draigtherapeutics.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Draig Clinical Site","city":"Phoenix","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85013","s":"R","lat":33.4484,"lon":-112.074,"c":"Draig Clinical Site · +44(0)2920028450 · info@draigtherapeutics.com"},{"f":"Draig Clinical Site","city":"Little Rock","pr":"Arkansas","zip":"72211","s":"R","lat":34.7465,"lon":-92.2896,"c":"Draig Clinical Site · +44(0)2920028450 · info@draigtherapeutics.com"},{"f":"Draig Clinical Site","city":"Bellflower","pr":"California","zip":"90706","s":"R","lat":33.8817,"lon":-118.117,"c":"Draig Clinical Site · +44(0)2920028450 · info@draigtherapeutics.com"},{"f":"Draig Clinical Site","city":"Costa Mesa","pr":"California","zip":"92626","s":"R","lat":33.6411,"lon":-117.9187,"c":"Draig Clinical Site · +44(0)2920028450 · info@draigtherapeutics.com"},{"f":"Draig Clinical Site","city":"Lafayette","pr":"California","zip":"94549","s":"R","lat":37.8858,"lon":-122.118,"c":"Draig Clinical Site · +44(0)2920028450 · info@draigtherapeutics.com"},{"f":"Draig Clinical Site","city":"Hialeah","pr":"Florida","zip":"33016","s":"R","lat":25.8576,"lon":-80.2781,"c":"Draig Clinical Site · +44(0)2920028450 · info@draigtherapeutics.com"},{"f":"Draig Clinical Site","city":"Orlando","pr":"Florida","zip":"32803","s":"R","lat":28.5383,"lon":-81.3792,"c":"Draig Clinical Site · +44(0)2920028450 · info@draigtherapeutics.com"},{"f":"Draig Clinical Site","city":"Orlando","pr":"Florida","zip":"32807","s":"R","lat":28.5383,"lon":-81.3792,"c":"Draig Clinical Site · +44(0)2920028450 · info@draigtherapeutics.com"},{"f":"Draig Clinical Site","city":"Tampa","pr":"Florida","zip":"33607","s":"R","lat":27.9475,"lon":-82.4584,"c":"Draig Clinical Site · +44(0)2920028450 · info@draigtherapeutics.com"},{"f":"Draig Clinical